(The relationship between telomere length and beekeeping among Malaysians) Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
14 TL
() Tj T*
(Nasir NF, Kannan TP, Sulaiman SA, Shamsuddin S, Azlina A, Stangaciu S. Age \(Dordrecht\). 2015 ) Tj T*
(Jun; 37\(3\):9797 \(published online 2 Jun 2015\). DOI: 10.1007/s11357-015-9797-6   PMID: 26028466 ) Tj T*
(  PMCID: PMC4450150) Tj T*
